  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在以前的课程里，我们已经熟悉了由数和变量组成的式，式中用到加、减、乘、除和乘方运算．这样的式叫做有理式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "在以前的课程里，我们已经熟悉了由数和变量组成的式，式中用到加、减、乘、除和乘方运算．这样的式叫做有理式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下列各式都是有理式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "下列各式都是有理式：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$a^2-3a+5$；\n$\\frac{x^2-2xy+y^2}{8}$；\n$a-\\frac{7b}{4c}$；\n$2k-p(k+p)$；\n$\\frac{a+b}{a-2b}$；\n$13.2x:12$；\n\n$\\frac{(a+b)^2-2ab}{a^2+b^2}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "$a^2-3a+5$；$\\frac{x^2-2xy+y^2}{8}$；$a-\\frac{7b}{4c}$；$2k-p(k+p)$；$\\frac{a+b}{a-2b}$；$13.2x:12$；$\\frac{(a+b)^2-2ab}{a^2+b^2}$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在所列举的这些有理式中，有一些不包括除以含变量的式子的除法运算，如：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "在所列举的这些有理式中，有一些不包括除以含变量的式子的除法运算，如：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$a^2-3a+5$；\n$\\frac{x^2-2xy+y^2}{8}$；\n$2k-p(k+p)$；\n\n$13.2x:12$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "$a^2-3a+5$；$\\frac{x^2-2xy+y^2}{8}$；$2k-p(k+p)$；$13.2x:12$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "没有除以含变量式子的除法运算的有理式，叫做整式．显然，整式对其中所含变量的所有值都有意义．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "没有除以含变量式子的除法运算的有理式，叫做整式．显然，整式对其中所含变量的所有值都有意义．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们在六年级已经知道，任何整式都可以表示成多项式的形式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "我们在六年级已经知道，任何整式都可以表示成多项式的形式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，整式 $(2a-1)(2a+1)-(3a^2+a-1)$ 恒等于多项式$a^2-a$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "例如，整式 $(2a-1)(2a+1)-(3a^2+a-1)$ 恒等于多项式$a^2-a$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上，$(2a-1)(2a+1)-(3a^2+a-1)$ $=(4a^2-1)-(3a^2+a-1)=a^2-a$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 1,
      "source_text": "实际上，$(2a-1)(2a+1)-(3a^2+a-1)$ $=(4a^2-1)-(3a^2+a-1)=a^2-a$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式 $\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}$ 是两个分式的积．这个有理式不是整式，因为其中一个分式的分母中含有变量．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 2,
      "source_text": "式 $\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}$ 是两个分式的积．这个有理式不是整式，因为其中一个分式的分母中含有变量．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用分式的乘法法则和基本性质，我们可以把这个式子变形成一个分式，它的分子和分母是多项式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 2,
      "source_text": "应用分式的乘法法则和基本性质，我们可以把这个式子变形成一个分式，它的分子和分母是多项式：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}=\\frac{(x+1)5(5+x)}{5(x+1)(x-1)}=\\frac{5+x}{x-1}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 2,
      "source_text": "$\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}=\\frac{(x+1)5(5+x)}{5(x+1)(x-1)}=\\frac{5+x}{x-1}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "等式 $\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}=\\frac{5+x}{x-1}$ 对于使它左右两边有意义的所有 $x$ 值都成立．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 2,
      "source_text": "等式 $\\frac{x+1}{5}\\cdot\\frac{25+5x}{x^2-1}=\\frac{5+x}{x-1}$ 对于使它左右两边有意义的所有 $x$ 值都成立．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们以后会看到，任何有理式都可以表示成一个分式，它的分子和分母是多项式（包括单项式）．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 2,
      "source_text": "我们以后会看到，任何有理式都可以表示成一个分式，它的分子和分母是多项式（包括单项式）．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
